  "reasoning": "The defendant Zhang deliberately caused the newborn twins to be left without care by demanding the hospital stop treatment and handing the infants to a taxi driver to abandon them. This conduct constitutes the criminal offense of abandoning a minor (遗弃罪) under Chinese criminal law, as it involves the intentional abandonment of children under the age of 14. No other offenses such as kidnapping, homicide, or assault are indicated in the facts.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]遗弃罪<eoa>"
